# Commits that are pure reformatting, skipped by `git blame`.
#
# `git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs` makes blame walk past them, so
# the line you are reading points at the change that wrote it rather than at the sweep that
# moved it. Only commits whose **entire** content is layout belong here: a commit that also
# changed behaviour must stay blameable, or the file would hide the very change it records.
#
# The format commit below is the one that made `ruff format` a gate. It is 138 files with
# 1217 insertions and 1043 deletions, every one of them whitespace, wrapping or a trailing
# comma — verified by running the full suite on it (1886 passed, 254 skipped) and by the
# fact that nothing but layout changed.
